                        <br/>
                        <br/>

                        See you soon,
                        <br/>
                        <br/>


                        Best Regards,
                        <br/>

                        HR Team
                        <br/>

                        National Technology for Software
                        <br/>

                    </div>
                </p>

            </field>
            <field name="lang">{{ object.partner_id.lang }}</field>

        </record>
        <record id="refuse_applicant_template" model="mail.template">
            <field name="name">Applicant: Refuse</field>
            <field name="model_id" ref="nt_recruitment_update.model_hr_applicant"/>
            <field name="subject">Your Job Application: {{object.job_id.name}}</field>
<!--            <field name="email_from">{{user.email_formatted or object.company_id.email or object.user_id.email}}</field>-->
            <field name="email_from">{{object.company_id.email}}</field>
            <field name="email_to">{{object.email_from}}</field>
            <field name="body_html" type="html">
                <p>
                    <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                        Dear :
                        <span>
                            <t t-out="object.name or ''"/>

                        </span>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        Thank you for your interest in joining National Technology as a<t
                            t-out="object.job_id.name or ''"/>.
                        <br/>
                        After careful consideration, we regret to inform you that you have not been selected for this
                        role.
                        <br/>
                        The selection process was very competitive and there are currently a limited number of
                        vacancies.
                        <br/>
                        We encourage you to regularly review our career page for all available vacancies for which you
                        qualify.
                        <br/>

                        We wish you all the best during your job search. ,
                        <br/>
                        <br/>


                        Best Regards,
                        <br/>

                        HR Team
                        <br/>

                        National Technology for Software
                        <br/>

                    </div>
                </p>

            </field>
            <field name="lang">{{ object.partner_id.lang }}</field>

        </record>
        <record id="employed_applicant_template" model="mail.template">
            <field name="name">Applicant: Employed</field>
            <field name="model_id" ref="nt_recruitment_update.model_hr_applicant"/>
            <field name="subject">Your Job Application: {{object.job_id.name}}</field>
<!--            <field name="email_from">{{user.email_formatted or object.company_id.email or object.user_id.email}}</field>-->
            <field name="email_from">{{object.company_id.email}}</field>
            <field name="email_to">{{object.email_from}}</field>
            <field name="body_html" type="html">
                <p>
                    <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                        Dear :
                        <span>
                            <t t-out="object.name or ''"/>

                        </span>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        Congratulations on starting your new journey with us.
                        <br/>


                        Upon our agreement, kindly find attached the required working documents that are needed from you
                        in your first working day with National Technology.
                        <br/>

                        waiting for you<t t-out="object.availability or ''"/>.
                        <br/>
                        <br/>

                        See you soon,
                        <br/>
                        <br/>


                        Best Regards,
                        <br/>

                        HR Team
                        <br/>

                        National Technology for Software
                        <br/>

                    </div>
                </p>

            </field>
            <field name="lang">{{ object.partner_id.lang }}</field>

        </record>
        <record id="final_interview_template" model="mail.template">
            <field name="name">Applicant: Final Interview</field>
            <field name="model_id" ref="nt_recruitment_update.model_hr_applicant"/>
            <field name="subject">Your Job Application: {{object.job_id.name}}</field>
<!--            <field name="email_from">{{user.email_formatted or object.company_id.email or object.user_id.email}}</field>-->
            <field name="email_from">{{object.company_id.email}}</field>
            <field name="email_to">{{object.email_from}}</field>
            <field name="body_html" type="html">
                <p>
                    <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                        Dear :
                        <span>
                            <t t-out="object.name or ''"/>

                        </span>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        Congratulations!
                        <br/>

                        You have passed the second interview and your final interview will be on
                        <t t-out="format_datetime(object.interview_date, tz=object.user_id.tz, dt_format=&quot;yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'&quot;)"/>
                        as<t t-out="object.job_id.name or ''"/>.
                        <br/>
                        <br/>

                        See you soon,
                        <br/>
                        <br/>


                        Best Regards,
                        <br/>

                        HR Team
                        <br/>

                        National Technology for Software
                        <br/>

                    </div>
                </p>

            </field>
            <field name="lang">{{ object.partner_id.lang }}</field>

        </record>

        <record id="hr_interview_template" model="mail.template">
            <field name="name">Applicant: Hr Interview</field>
            <field name="model_id" ref="nt_recruitment_update.model_hr_applicant"/>
            <field name="subject">Your Job Application: {{object.job_id.name}}</field>
<!--            <field name="email_from">{{user.email_formatted or object.company_id.email or object.user_id.email}}</field>-->
            <field name="email_from">{{object.company_id.email}}</field>
            <field name="email_to">{{object.email_from}}</field>
            <field name="body_html" type="html">
                <p>
                    <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                        Dear :
                        <span>
                            <t t-out="object.name or ''"/>

                        </span>
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        As per our conversation, kindly find the interview appointment below:
                        <br/>
                        Your Interview will be on
                        <t t-out="format_datetime(object.interview_date, tz=object.user_id.tz, dt_format=&quot;yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'&quot;)"/>
                        as<t t-out="object.job_id.name or ''"/>.
                        <br/>

                        Please note that you have to:
                        <br/>
                        1- Fill the attached "Application Form".
                        <br/>
                        2- Answer the attached "Disc Assessment".
                        <br/>

                        • Read the assessment’s instructions carefully before answering it.
                        <br/>
                        • Choose only one language to answer the assessment, Arabic or English.
                        <br/>

                        <br/>
                        You have to send both "The Application" and "The Assessment" by choosing Reply to all.
                        <br/>
                        This step reduces the time consumed in the interview’s day and helps us get a better time
                        management among all the applied candidates, so please commit to this as it is not an optional
                        action.
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        Extremely important note:
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                        The attached "Disc Assessment" and "Application Form" are only for Business Use and Not allowed
                        to
                        be shared personally with others out of this context, they’re COPYRIGHTED © to National
                        Technology.
                        <br/>
                        Company Website: www.nt-me.com

                        <br/>
                        Company Address: 18 شارع احمد الزمر امام بوابة معهد بحوث البترول الدور الرابع مدينة نصر بجوار
                        شركة انبى

                        <br/>
                        https://www.google.com.eg/maps/place/National+Technology/@30.045382,31.3422346,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xb29cd668cb5f63b2
                        <br/>
                        Wishing you best of luck

                        <br/>


                        Best Regards,
                        <br/>

                        HR Team
                        <br/>

                        National Technology for Software
                        <br/>

                    </div>
                </p>

            </field>
            <field name="lang">{{ object.partner_id.lang }}</field>

        </record>
    </data>
</odoo>